Package: jotta-gui
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: jotta-cli, libc6, libgl1, libdbus-1-3, libxkbcommon0, libxcb1
Description: Desktop interface for Jottacloud CLI
 Jotta GUI is a PySide6 desktop interface for jotta-cli and jottad.
 It provides account and storage overview, Sync controls, Backup ignore-rule
 management, daemon settings, and Jottacloud CLI version status.
